### Peticiones de ejemplo para el Entregable 1 (extensión "REST Client" de VS Code)
### Ejecuta en orden: haz clic en "Send Request" sobre cada bloque.

@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000/api

//Estado del servicio
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### 1.1 Registrar usuario  (201)
# @name register
POST {{baseUrl}}/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Carlos Zatarain",
  "email": "carlos@example.com",
  "password": "secreto123"
}

### 1.2 Registrar con correo repetido (400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Carlos Zatarain",
  "email": "carlos@example.com",
  "password": "secreto123"
}

### 1.3 Login  (200)
# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/users/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "carlos@example.com",
  "password": "secreto123"
}

### 1.4 Login con contraseña incorrecta (400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/users/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "carlos@example.com",
  "password": "123"
}

###
@token = {{login.response.body.token}}

### 1.5 Perfil con token (200)
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 1.6 Perfil sin token (401)
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/me

### 2.1 Crear producto (201)  -> copia el _id de la respuesta
# @name createProduct
POST {{baseUrl}}/products
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Hoodie ",
  "description": "Hoodie azul marino",
  "price": 899,
  "stock": 5,
  "size": ["M", "L"]
}

### 2.2 Crear producto sin token (401)
POST {{baseUrl}}/products
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Gorra", "price": 250, "stock": 10, "size": "U" }

### 2.3 Listar productos (200)
GET {{baseUrl}}/products

###
@productId = {{createProduct.response.body._id}}

### 2.4 Detalle de producto (200)
GET {{baseUrl}}/products/{{productId}}

### 2.5 Producto inexistente (404)
GET {{baseUrl}}/products/000000000000000000000000

### 3.1 Crear pedido (201) - el total lo calcula el servidor
POST {{baseUrl}}/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "items": [ { "_id": "{{productId}}", "quantity": 2 } ]
}

### 3.2 Pedido con cantidad mayor al stock (400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "items": [ { "_id": "{{productId}}", "quantity": 999 } ]
}

### 3.3 Mis pedidos (200)
GET {{baseUrl}}/orders/my-orders
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
